      "body": "Over the last 90 days, the stock has fallen 14% to ₹328. The fair value is estimated to be ₹272, however this is not to be taken as a sell recommendation but rather should be used as a guide only. Revenue has grown by 5.7% over the last 3 years, while earnings per share has been flat. For the next 3 years, revenue is forecast to grow by 6.6% per annum. Earnings are also forecast to grow by 22% per annum over the same time period.",
